WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
Tomorrow's tours are booked. But are the assigned guides confirmed?

00:08.000 --> 00:18.000
The sample instruction becomes actionable work: booking 2871 needs a current guide confirmation.

00:18.000 --> 00:28.000
The operations team reviews the 09:00 version 3 booking and explicitly approves a simulated request.

00:28.000 --> 00:37.000
The guide confirms 09:00 on an operator-branded page. Response received does not mean verified.

00:37.000 --> 00:45.000
Gappy compares the reply with the current booking and verifies the version 3 confirmation.

00:45.000 --> 00:55.000
The booking changes from 09:00 to 10:30. Version 3 is invalidated and version 4 requires reconfirmation.

00:55.000 --> 01:00.000
From a material change to a current verified outcome. See how this fits your operation. Book a demo.
